{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ、撮影で盆栽を頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右のと左の。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛くてすごくお気に入り。\n大切に育ててこ ♩♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お部屋の一角が\nどんどん賑わってきた～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半分くらい貰い物。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は、握手会  有難うございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいにとって、最後の握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ46時間TVやイベントやライブも残ってるけど、\nどんどん終わりが近づいて、\nひとつひとつなくなっていくのを目の前にしていると、寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最後まで、まいまいが笑顔でいられますように。。\nとりあえず、握手会  お疲れさま！！(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：Another Edition"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：Another Edition"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：古着"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：Converse"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１部は羽織ものなし。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「写ルンです」30thアニバーサリーの、\n限定のやつかわいい。渋い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで庭園巡り、沢山したいな**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本庭園に行きたい。\nとにかく島根に行きたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足立美術館に一度行ってみたいのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここの庭園が、アメリカの日本庭園専門誌\n『Sukiya Living/The Journal of Japanese Gardening』で、\n「13年連続日本一」に選ばれているとラジオで聞いてから、\nずっとずっと気になっているんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生で見れたら相当感動するだろうなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬は苦手だから、あったかい季節のうちに\n叶うといいなあ～ ○△□"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだは、れなちさんが\nうちにお泊まりにきてました(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に 晩ごはん作って食べて、\n色んな話したりしてほんと楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日も朝から一緒に\n「ﾃﾞｨｽﾄﾗｸｼｮﾝ·ﾍﾞｲﾋﾞｰｽﾞ」を観に行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日発売された、2ndアルバム\n「それぞれの椅子」\n皆さま 手にして頂けたでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特典映像も盛り沢山です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなとこも撮ってあったんだあって\n恥ずかしくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分まりかと居ると、小学生の男子みたいな\nノリになる習性があるようで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとよく走りまわります。（笑）\n嬉しかったり楽しかったりすると走るよね！(((o( ˆoˆ )o)))ｽﾞﾄﾞﾄﾞﾄﾞﾄﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、「はいどうもこんばんわー！」\nってのは、グループ魂さんのやつです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく好きなんです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、10日のMステ良かったら\n見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/04/4900056/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}